# The owner's ruling of 2026-11-21 (docs/engine-design.md, "Taking back an illegal action"): nothing hidden is revealed for
# anything that can still be undone, so what a cost would make known is carried out as the cast is committed. Bolas's
# Citadel casts Bone Splinters off the top of the library for 1 life, and Ashiok, Wicked Manipulator exiles the next card,
# Lightning Bolt, in place of that life (CR 119.4, 614.1a). Nothing the sacrifice may choose reads the library or exile
# (Memnite has no characteristic-defining ability), so the order of the payment's steps is not asked (CR 601.2h) and the
# life is paid last: while the sacrifice is chosen, nothing is in exile and the Bolt is still on top of the library. Once
# Memnite is chosen the cast is committed, and the Bolt is exiled with the life still 20. Bone Splinters destroys its
# target.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
